  "name": "BrightLasers",
  "slug": "brightlasers",
  "teaser": "Brighter lasers for your guns. No more blue laser, best laser. (It's still the best)",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1880.png",
  "downloads": 109864,
  "favourites_count": 98,
  "description": "<p>I only created this because both prior mods that updated laser level are outdated, and I wanted to learn how to do bundles.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IctaBLR.gif\" alt=\"A8q0NLy.png\" /></p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download BrightLasers</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the zip file</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"wMIskD3.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-brightlasers</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<hr />\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
